			<div class="content" id="post-content-1505529">
									

<p>I want to upvote for the twist - it's unexpected. But the narrator doesn't have a whoooole lot of personality, and what's there doesn't gel as much as I wish it would. The suicide element is overdone but it seems integral to the story (I could be wrong, but I can't think of a way to remove it entirely). So&#8230; no vote, for now.</p>
<p>But if you rewrite, keep the twist. It's good.</p>

